{"sections":[{"slug":"紧合几何态射","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"紧合几何态射"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">紧合几何态射</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“紧合几何态射”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称意象</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧意象是指</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/整体截面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体截面</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的直像部分保持</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/子终对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">子终对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的定向并</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">态射</span> $f\\colon \\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧合的</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">是指其为</span> $\\mathcal E$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的紧意象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个条件可用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/叠语义","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">叠语义</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">表述</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}